{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"jay-underwood","name":"Jay Underwood","birthDate":"1968-10-01","birthPlace":"Minneapolis, Minnesota, USA","bio":"Jay Underwood (born October 1, 1968) is an American actor and pastor. Beginning a prolific career as a teen actor in the mid-1980s, he is perhaps best known for his starring feature film roles, portraying Eric Gibb in The Boy Who Could Fly, Chip Carson in Not Quite Human, Grover Dunn in The Invisible Kid, Sonny Bono in The Sonny and Cher Story, Bug in Uncle Buck, and Ernest Hemingway in The Young Indiana Jones Chronicles. He also portrayed the Human Torch in the 1994 unreleased film Fantastic Four.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jay Underwood, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:37:20+00:00","tmdbId":27493,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/27493","credits":[{"id":"fantastic-four","title":"The Fantastic Four: First Steps","character":"Power Plant Worker #1"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/jay-underwood.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Fantastic 4: First Steps","year":2025,"character":"Power Plant Worker #1","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nf5qaSEvyYSNeFH0YhSs5EsBLX9.jpg"},{"name":"Surge of Power: Revenge of the Sequel","year":2018,"character":"Cross","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aC13mP7xOYpbDXzj7v2sYVGOAVY.jpg"},{"name":"Doomed! The Untold Story of Roger Corman's The Fantastic Four","year":2015,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eVWltbQgLbEvzfMyONWN4bU1jYW.jpg"},{"name":"No Greater Love","year":2010,"character":"Dave","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x6cfeMg12RHdsrNGm6did45YsZW.jpg"},{"name":"Where There's a Will","year":2006,"character":"Jimmy Ray","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gOF9dKDQl0ZI8JfiyEwI3zYnjt8.jpg"},{"name":"Annie's Point","year":2005,"char